<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 339 0 R
/E (Shandong Forge Alloy Racing Tech Co Ltd is a cutting-edge, fully integrated new enterprise rooted in Shandong, dedicated to premium automotive wheel exports. We command end-to-end expertise spanning innovative design, advanced R&D, and global sales and distribution networks. Our three flagship product lines, forged, flow-formed, and cast wheels, are crafted to deliver unrivaled structural integrity, featherlight efficiency, and head-turning aesthetics, tailored for discerning markets worldwide. We are backed by an elite R&D team harnessing FEA simulation tools, and stringent quality management systems certified to ISO 9001, the global gold standard for quality assurance, we also hold the prestigious DOT certification, a golden ticket to North American markets. We are fully compliant with strict FMVSS standards, every wheel undergoes rigorous fatigue and impact testing, guaranteeing consistent excellence backed by internationally recognized quality protocols. We are offering flexible OEM/ODM customization and robust after-sales support, we are committed to forging strategic partnerships across the globe. Choose Forge Alloy, where durability, performance, and style collide, driving your success to new heights.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [2]
>>
